            "text": "Chole",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "chole"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " gets its dark colour from black tea bags and tamarind added during cooking. The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "bhature",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "bhature"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " dough needs to rest for 30 minutes before rolling so it becomes pliable and puffs correctly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fry the bhature one at a time. Keep each one submerged in the oil and spoon hot oil over the top so it puffs evenly."
          }
        ]
